{'@type':'Question',name:'Can I save every page as its own PDF?',acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer',text:'Yes. Choose Split every page. Each page is copied into a separate PDF and downloaded sequentially. Your browser may ask to allow multiple downloads.'}},
